<li class="gallerybox" style="width: 86px;" id="mwsA"><div class="thumb" style="width: 84px;" id="mwsQ"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwsg"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:CMR_MacKay.jpg" class="mw-file-description" title="C. M. Russell statue by John Weaver; Identical statues are held in the National Statuary Hall Collection and by the Montana Historical Society." id="mwsw"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:CMR_MacKay.jpg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/CMR_MacKay.jpg/250px-CMR_MacKay.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/CMR_MacKay.jpg/330px-CMR_MacKay.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="C. M. Russell statue by John Weaver; Identical statues are held in the National Statuary Hall Collection and by the Montana Historical Society." data-file-width="1276" data-file-height="2272" data-file-type="bitmap" height="150" width="84" class="mw-file-element" id="mwtA"/></a></span></div><div class="gallerytextwrapper" style="width: 64px;" id="mwtQ"><div class="gallerytext" id="mwtg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charles_Marion_Russell_(Weaver)" title="Charles Marion Russell (Weaver)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwtw">C. M. Russell statue</a> by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Weaver_(artist)" title="John Weaver (artist)" id="mwuA">John Weaver</a>; Identical statues are held in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Statuary_Hall_Collection" title="National Statuary Hall Collection" id="mwuQ">National Statuary Hall Collection</a> and by the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Montana_Historical_Society" title="Montana Historical Society" id="mwug">Montana Historical Society</a>.</div></div></li>
