<li class="gallerybox" style="width: 201.33333333333px;" id="mwAlA"><div class="thumb" style="width: 199.33333333333px;" id="mwAlE"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwAlI"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Indians_DiscoveringLC.jpg" class="mw-file-description" title="The Indians discovering Lewis and Clark. Russell depicted various stages of the Lewis and Clark Expedition in a number of works." id="mwAlM"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Indians_DiscoveringLC.jpg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Indians_DiscoveringLC.jpg/330px-Indians_DiscoveringLC.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Indians_DiscoveringLC.jpg/960px-Indians_DiscoveringLC.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="The Indians discovering Lewis and Clark. Russell depicted various stages of the Lewis and Clark Expedition in a number of works." data-file-width="1764" data-file-height="1330" data-file-type="bitmap" height="150" width="200" class="mw-file-element" id="mwAlQ"/></a></span></div><div class="gallerytext" id="mwAlU"><i id="mwAlY">The Indians discovering Lewis and Clark</i>. Russell depicted various stages of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lewis_and_Clark_Expedition" title="Lewis and Clark Expedition" id="mwAlc">Lewis and Clark Expedition</a> in a number of works.</div></li>
